{"abstract":"Abstract The concept of ‘Hybrid museum experiences’ is inspired by New Museology, and looks at how museum experiences can be made more meaningful by giving visitors agency in their museum experience. The chapter emphasises how museum experiences are inherently social, and looks at how hybrid museum experiences can be made meaningful through tapping into social practices and the visitors’ social context","author_count":8,"contributors":["Løvlie, Anders Sundnes","Waern, Annika","Eklund, Lina","Spence, Jocelyn","Rajkowska, Paulina","Benford, Steve"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382512"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Nottingham","Uppsala University"],"keyword":["Hybrid museum experiences","New Museology","Social context","Social practices","Visitor agency"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hybrid museum experiences","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/93100277/Hybrid_Museum_Experiences.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382512","ids":["itu-52ed1f96-57b1-4fab-a9aa-037b9df3d18c"],"keyword":["Hybrid museum experiences","New Museology","Social context","Social practices","Visitor agency"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2A5BC683CE41F29EF22434EDB0D844C5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/93100277/Hybrid_Museum_Experiences.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it universi