{"abstract":"This article brings together two strands of research that have the potential to inform the development of constructive forms of journalism: online comments and media design. Through a three-year-long case study of the development of new formats for online comments on the website of the Danish Broadcasting Corporation, I explore the challenges encountered from two perspectives: the design features of the commenting system and the design process. While the broadcaster has emphasized developing features for strengthening editorial control, user engagement has faltered. A lack of attention to users in the design process seems to have contributed to the problems. These findings have implications for constructive journalism’s ambitions to facilitate audience engagement, in particular when tied to online platforms.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Løvlie, Anders Sundnes"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382968"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Constructive journalism","Design","Human Computer Interaction","Interaction design","Media design","Online comments","User experience","participatory journalism"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"constructive comments designing an online debate system for the danish broadcasting corporation","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83143866/lovlie_constructive_comments_postprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382968","identifier":[{"id":"85047273544","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-7301b542-e8a8-4721-aa47-4f36f0dc20a6"],"keyword":["constructive journalism","design","human-computer interaction","interaction design","media design","online comments","participatory journalism","user experience"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-C860E53A58B26BBC2EDE9691AF866F62"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83143866/lovlie_constructive_comments_postprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, Audio-Visual Computing","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Play, Culture, and AI, Media, Art & Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Sundnes","key":"løvliepau","last":"Løvlie","locid":"22ec9269-2fff-4dbf-a9c7-5037559a15ee","name":"Løvlie, Anders Sundnes","orcid":"0000-0003-0484-4668","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/17512786.2018.1473042","issn":["14616211","17512786"],"issn_org":["17512786"],"journal":"Journalism Practice","pages":"781-798","publisher":"Routledge","status":"p","title":"Journalism Practice"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85047273544"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-7301b542-e8a8-4721-aa47-4f36f0dc20a6"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Constructive Comments? : Designing an online debate system for the Danish Broadcasting Corporation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382968","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
