odus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382322","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Based on data from a survey among contributors (n=3470) to the online comments sections of four Norwegian newspapers, we investigate the following research question: How do contributors to online comments sections in newspaper websites describe their experiences of repercussions from participation in debates? Through analysis of two survey questions asking respondents whether they have experienced problems in everyday life after participating in online comments, we find that women to a larger degree report such problems. However, when studying the types of problems reported, we fail to replicate earlier findings about gender differences associated with different types of problems. Instead, we find a surprising dominance of relatively inconsequential issues, leading to a discussion about the communicative competencies of participants, and the challenge in facilitating online debate for people with limited knowledge and experience about what kind of repercussions to expect when posting controversial opinions in a public forum.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Løvlie, Anders Sundnes","Ihlebæk, Karoline Andrea"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382173"],"event":{"end":"2016-10-08","place":"Berlin, de","start":"2016-10-05","title":"Association of Internet Researchers' Annual Conference","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Oslo"],"keyword":["Gender differences","Newspaper Websites","Online comments","communicative competencies","repercussions"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"experiences of repercussions from participation in online debate","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-382173","ids":["itu-3d2859a5-6aba-4e89-923d-79727381c6c6"],"keyword":["communicative competencies","gender differences","newspaper websites","online comments","repercussions"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-67A8F691A2A36E4D26227098772F9F88"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Digital Play","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","The Department, Digital Society and Communication"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"no","key":"university of oslo","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Oslo","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Sundnes","key":"løvliepau","last":"Løvlie","locid":"22ec9269-2fff-4dbf-a9c7-5037559a15ee","name":"Løvlie, Anders Sundnes","orcid":"0000-0003-0484-4668","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Karoline Andrea","key":"ihlebækpau","last":"Ihlebæk","name":"Ihlebæk, Karoline Andrea","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-3d2859a5-6aba-4e89-923d-79727381c6c6"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"EXPERIENCES OF REPERCUSSIONS FROM PARTICIPATION IN ONLINE DEBATE","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382173","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
